```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NO_TASK_IN_PROGRESS
    NO_TASK_IN_PROGRESS --> STARTING_EXECUTION: executeProposals()
    STARTING_EXECUTION --> INTER_BROKER_REPLICA_MOVEMENT: Phase 1 Start
    INTER_BROKER_REPLICA_MOVEMENT --> LEADER_MOVEMENT: Phase 1 Complete
    LEADER_MOVEMENT --> NO_TASK_IN_PROGRESS: Phase 2 Complete

    INTER_BROKER_REPLICA_MOVEMENT --> STOPPING_EXECUTION: stopExecution()
    LEADER_MOVEMENT --> STOPPING_EXECUTION: stopExecution()

    STOPPING_EXECUTION --> STOPPED_WITH_ERROR: Error During Stop
    STOPPING_EXECUTION --> NO_TASK_IN_PROGRESS: Clean Stop

    STOPPED_WITH_ERROR --> NO_TASK_IN_PROGRESS: Reset

    note right of INTER_BROKER_REPLICA_MOVEMENT
        Move replicas between brokers
        Monitor ISR status
        Apply bandwidth throttling
    end note

    note right of LEADER_MOVEMENT
        Transfer leadership
        Call electLeaders()
        Update ClusterModel
    end note
```
